extrema desde el primer d\u00eda. Sigue a Xploit ZERO en redes sociales y ay\u00fadanos a llevar la innovaci\u00f3n a\u00fan m\u00e1s lejos.", "short_description": "Xploit ZERO es el juego de acci\u00f3n y estrategia en Realidad Mixta que convierte tu habitaci\u00f3n en un campo de batalla. Piensa r\u00e1pido, construye tus defensas y reacciona en tiempo real para repeler a los invasores en partidas cortas, intensas y llenas de diversi\u00f3n. \u00bfTe atreves?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Xploit_zero_360.2.png", "id": "26529534970073330", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/595136811_26529534980073329_7286307846810146766_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J4LbZBhO-qQQ7kNvwFn7Eio&_nc_oc=AdoKOSYyA332NhBa-mgB7RGUx6xwp6n2xYUOV93V4sclCeyUWl8d4gdaV6Zkq5E-DVY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRUYFTE3F432-i1qP_NohWKhO__R_pq2G6V48oribbcvw&oe=6AF9CDD6"}, {"file_name": "Shot2.png", "id": "26394552166891673", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828104_26394552180225005_6856735165680477736_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zaWTKYXlJQYQ7kNvwEizqNP&_nc_oc=AdqlzkeQOb4YPGW9XFHsPn_tV5gm1uCkUOvKo3m4geIRGSLN5t5bKg5bnMpqazF0RgU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQVXoC6K1RddZkQ2zgI1pQyjV8c5j8CaMudk145QN3jtw&oe=6AF9D522"}, {"file_name": "Shot5.png", "id": "3160157457501506", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298502_3160157460834839_8317283677516400765_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ky7ElZFrGjsQ7kNvwHJqw3T&_nc_oc=Ado9eseU8Cs7Tf5y6ZrTujFHe2oUnNFJ167D7t6Wj85Y2QtT1Lm9HTs28gYOakw2hyc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS_NcXFCxipwmCPqrLauM1Ps7P5Zs2t7C9LwXn9VDpMTw&oe=6AF9DD19"}, {"file_name": "Shot3.png", "id": "2659403194432547", "image_type":